  "changes": [
    [
      "Opaque panes and pearl instead of the sketch's clear glass",
      "R337 (Ryan, Nov 19): nothing see-through."
    ],
    [
      "Two arched bridges, the turret blister on the crown of the forward one",
      "The sketch's curved bridges; a blister on the bridge crown clears both hulls through a full turn (turret T, 360)."
    ],
    [
      "Stored light on the hulls' inner flanks and under the bridges, not a pool in open space",
      "The cleft is open space between two hulls; the glow sits on the glass that faces it."
    ],
    [
      "Each bow lens point is a short drawn-glass lance with a glowing tip on the hull's axis",
      "cruiser.md: keep them points, never tubes; one pulsar per hull."
    ]
